# Templates

All JSON templates must follow this exact structure:

## Required Schema
```json
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["sections"],
  "properties": {
    "sections": {
      "type": "object",
      "patternProperties": {
        "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["type"],
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$"
            },
            "settings": {
              "type": "object"
            },
            "blocks": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["type"],
                "properties": {
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "settings": {
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "order": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## Template Structure Rules

- Every template must have a `sections` object
- Section keys must be alphanumeric with dashes/underscores
- Each section must have a `type` property
- `settings` and `blocks` are optional
- `order` array defines section sequence
- Blocks must have a `type` property


## Template Types

**Standard Templates:**
- `index.json` - Homepage
- `product.json` - Product pages
- `collection.json` - Collection pages
- `page.json` - Static pages
- `blog.json` - Blog listing
- `article.json` - Blog posts
- `cart.json` - Shopping cart
- `search.json` - Search results

**Alternate Templates:**
Alternative templates may exist for any of the standard templates, following the structure `template-name.template-suffix.template-file-type`, for example: `product.alternate.json`

**Collection PLP sidebar:** **Sidebar filters** (`collection_listing_layout`: `plp_sidebar`) is the default for new `main-collection` sections and for [`templates/collection.json`](templates/collection.json). It applies vertical filters, a narrow left facet column, three desktop columns, and hides grid-density controls (same behavior as [`templates/collection.plp-sidebar.json`](templates/collection.plp-sidebar.json)). On desktop, the vertical facet column is **sticky** (`position: sticky` on `.facets-block-wrapper--vertical` in [`blocks/filters.liquid`](blocks/filters.liquid)), offset below `--header-height`, with `overflow-y: auto` if the filter list is taller than the viewport. When vertical facets are present, `results-list.section` children are set to `grid-column: 1 / -1` with horizontal `padding-inline` so the PLP uses the full viewport width instead of the default `.section` center column. In [`snippets/product-grid.liquid`](snippets/product-grid.liquid), `.main-collection-grid .product-grid__item` uses `justify-self: stretch` so each card fills its grid cell (no per-item max-width). Merchants who want the previous layout choose **Standard** (`default`): horizontal filters plus **Desktop product columns** and **Filter sidebar width** in the section settings. When adding schema keys for `main-collection`, add matching keys to every `locales/*.schema.json` (or run a small merge script) so `shopify theme check` passes `MatchingTranslations`.

## Valid Template Examples

**Product Template:**
```json
{
  "sections": {
    "header": {
      "type": "header"
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "settings": {
        "show_vendor": true,
        "show_sku": false,
        "media_size": "medium"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {
            "show_compare_at": true
          }
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "dropdown"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["title", "price", "variant_picker"]
    },
    "footer": {
      "type": "footer"
    }
  },
  "order": ["header", "main", "footer"]
}
```

**Collection Template:**
```json
{
  "sections": {
    "header": {
      "type": "header"
    },
    "collection-banner": {
      "type": "collection-banner",
      "settings": {
        "show_collection_description": true,
        "show_collection_image": false
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-collection-product-grid",
      "settings": {
        "products_per_page": 24,
        "columns_desktop": 4,
        "columns_mobile": 2
      }
    }
  },
  "order": ["header", "collection-banner", "main"]
}
```
